  - key: ChrisDead
    name: "Thi th\u1EC3 c\u1EE7a Chris"
    description: "Chris ch\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t v\u1EBFt b\u1EAFn ngay s\xE1t
      th\xE1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng, ngay v\u1ECB tr\xED b\u1ECB b\u1EAFn v\u1EABn c\xF2n
      d\u1EA5u hi\u1EC7u kh\xF3i thu\u1ED1c s\xFAng tr\xEAn \u0111\xF3 nh\u01B0 th\u1EC3
      s\xFAng \u0111\xE3 \xE1p s\xE1t v\xE0o \u0111\u1EA7u"
    playerGuide: "C\xF3 th\u1EC3 h\u1ECFi 2 v\u1ECB c\u1EA3nh s\xE1t \u0111\u1EC3
